{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"## T1\n\n### Applicant Notice: Use of ResumeRank v3 in Hiring\n\n[Employer Name] uses an artificial-intelligence-assisted tool called ResumeRank v3 during some hiring processes. The tool produces a score based on information processed from an applicant’s submitted materials. A recruiter reviews the score and may override it; the score is not necessarily the final hiring decision.\n\nWe are reviewing and will provide additional information about:\n\n- the data used to develop and evaluate the tool;\n- the information considered when generating scores, including whether protected characteristics or related information are used;\n- the tool’s validation and performance results;\n- how long applicant information and scores are retained;\n- whether vendors or other parties can access the information;\n- what explanations are available to applicants;\n- how applicants may request review, correction, or reconsideration; and\n- applicable legal and compliance safeguards.\n\nFor questions or to request information about how ResumeRank v3 was used in your application, contact [contact name/email]. Until these details are confirmed, the employer should not publish statements claiming that the tool is unbiased, compliant, validated, or free from protected-attribute use.\n\n## T2\n\n“The weekly meeting starts at nine.”"}}
